{"5079510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Soul Tamer", "steam_appid": 5079510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [5084290], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect souls. Make allies. Adventure together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In SoulTamer, defeated monsters sometimes drop their souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a soul to the pet shop and that monster becomes your companion —</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fighting at your side, growing with you, and fusing into something stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat, befriend, fight together: over 500 species can join you </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companions fight beside you, level up, and pass their strength on through fusion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 dungeon floors, hidden areas, an endless tower, and a PVP arena</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Farend Plains: 17km of rolling hills and ridgelines — gentle in the south, deadly in the north</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 original Wildlands species and elemental spirits found nowhere else</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burrowing enemies, grand area spells for every element, lavish skill effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smithing, crafting, auctions, trading, banking, fishing and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op out of the box (party, chat, trade, PVP) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Japanese / English support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect souls. Make allies. Adventure together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In SoulTamer, defeated monsters sometimes drop their souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a soul to the pet shop and that monster becomes your companion —</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fighting at your side, growing with you, and fusing into something stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat, befriend, fight together: over 500 species can join you </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companions fight beside you, level up, and pass their strength on through fusion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 dungeon floors, hidden areas, an endless tower, and a PVP arena</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Farend Plains: 17km of rolling hills and ridgelines — gentle in the south, deadly in the north</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 original Wildlands species and elemental spirits found nowhere else</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burrowing enemies, grand area spells for every element, lavish skill effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smithing, crafting, auctions, trading, banking, fishing and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op out of the box (party, chat, trade, PVP) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Japanese / English support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Defeat monsters, make them your allies, and fight side by side. Their souls become companions that battle with you, grow with you, and fuse into something stronger. Explore 10 dungeon floors, a royal capital and the 17km Farend Plains — Over 500 species await, solo or with friends.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5079510/a6e0242de31dda9c95e7fa2440e7b30f82e3be28/header.jpg?t=1788344958", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5079510/3c1c49276b56d8880db6f88dcea17766b9b8e4ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788344958", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5079510/3c1c49276b56d8880db6f88dcea17766b9b8e4ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788344958", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 64ビット<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600 相当以上<